+| A16 gather offsets | On GFX10, `image_gather4_lz_o` and `image_gather4_l_o` take the packed signed texel offset in a full VGPR before the packed binary16 coordinates and optional LOD. LLVM [counts the extra operand before packing coordinate words](https://llvm.org/docs/doxygen/AMDGPUBaseInfo_8cpp_source.html#l00342). The synthetic `gather_offset_a16.asm` checks an offset of (−1,+1) with distinct U and V and a nonzero mip. |
